{"c":[{"id":"c55e5c34ee713bca","sum":"Root uv lock needs --no-config --refresh (--locked alone accepts a pytorch-index lock). CI pins uv 0.12.22; lock --refresh writes revision 5, and uv 0.8.22 rewrites it to 3. Bump that pin only with a refresh from 0.12.22. Semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"9d643efe7d7e9cc8","sum":"uv lock --locked without --refresh accepts a pytorch-index lock as current, so the root docs lock uses --no-config --refresh. Semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id; do not document JSON as the only handoff to query.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260913T191535Z-13e9bab5c49f07d0","text":"uv lock --locked without --refresh treats a pytorch-index lock as current; root docs lock must use --no-config --refresh.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T193807Z-4efc5d97f1279b70","text":"stockroom semantic tsv and table include session_id and message_id; do not document JSON as the only shape that can hand off to query.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"20fe4911ab451244","sum":"Root uv.lock revision is 5 for uv 0.12 lock --refresh --locked; uv 0.8.22 rewrites that revision to 3. CI uv is pinned to 0.12.22 in ci.yaml and docs.yaml. Bump that pin only together with a lock refresh from that same uv.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261002T194958Z-1341312456d701ec","text":"Root uv.lock revision is 5 for uv 0.12 lock --refresh --locked. uv 0.8.22 rewrites that revision back to 3.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261002T195915Z-9e5f10b38f9fb742","text":"CI uv is pinned to 0.12.22 in ci.yaml and docs.yaml. Bump that pin only together with a lock refresh from that same uv.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"c53d131b7fa46813","sum":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW, so semantic --harness/--role rank the joined set; never add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query. chore(semantic)! (ids before role) cut 2.0.0. BgeEncoder drops only the Hub unauthenticated notice; other _http warnings log.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"d133a7aa26b2284c","sum":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: a harness predicate plus ORDER BY distance LIMIT can return zero rows. Semantic tsv/table put session_id and message_id before role, a breaking shift marked chore(semantic)! so release-please cut 2.0.0.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T180756Z-1e00dec009646749","text":"DuckDB 1.5.4 VSS post-filters WHERE after HNSW: embeddings harness predicate plus ORDER BY distance LIMIT can return zero rows while matches exist.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T181638Z-94dbcd6e44d4af97","text":"Default semantic tsv and table insert session_id and message_id before role. That shift is breaking: marker commit chore(semantic)! so release-please cuts 2.0.0, not 1.3.0.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"8b5dfc860fd2304a","sum":"semantic --harness/--role rank embeddings joined to messages; never add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query (DuckDB VSS post-filters it). BgeEncoder drops only the Hub unauthenticated-request notice; other huggingface_hub _http warnings, incl. failed downloads, still log.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T195045Z-3d49f28ec61f9e73","text":"stockroom semantic --harness and --role rank embeddings joined to messages. Do not add WHERE to the HNSW LIMIT query; DuckDB VSS post-filters that shape.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T204959Z-929c764401ba7c67","text":"BgeEncoder drops the Hub unauthenticated-request notice. Other huggingface_hub.utils._http warnings, including a failed download, still log.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
